A select with a percentage width now compresses like a text input or a
textarea. Run in Chrome 157.0.8103.79, Firefox 151.0, and WebKit 26.5
(Playwright’s build), all three let a flex item around a select or a
listbox select with width: 100% shrink to its 60px container, and keep
the select’s default width with max-width: 100%, as Ladybird now does.
